# Only the wake-word and VAD models from the training tree go into the image, with the wake-word
# models' manifests (every one is a zakhar.json under v*/ or sits in esphome/; the other .json
# files there are training data) and the licenses the ESPHome models are redistributed under.
microWakeWord/**
!microWakeWord/**/*.tflite
!microWakeWord/**/zakhar.json
!microWakeWord/esphome/*.json
!microWakeWord/esphome/LICENSE
!microWakeWord/esphome/NOTICE
